    {
      "text": "PRISMA flow diagram (Figure 1): records from PubMed (n = 17), Web of Science (n = 38) and Embase (n = 72); 31 duplicate articles removed, giving 96 unique articles; 89 excluded after screening title and abstract, leaving 7 screened articles; 2 unpublished trials/studies added, for 9 articles/trials included.",
